I go out of the office after work.
I walk quickly to the station.
I still have an errand today.
I would like to go to a small coffee roaster by the river.
It is right on the other side of the city.
I look at my phone.
The app shows me the route.
First I must travel with the U-Bahn.
Then I must change trains.
After that I must travel with the S-Bahn to the river.
I look for my monthly pass in my backpack.
But it is not there.
It is lying on the kitchen table in the flat.
Therefore I must buy the tickets individually today.
One in the morning, and now another one.
The shop closes at six o'clock.
I must hurry!
